        <mxCell id="bg3" value="MCP server (:8091)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFEFA;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="60" width="240" height="1080" as="geometry" />
